WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:04.036
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show,"
here, from New York City.

00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:06.839
Hey, everybody.
Thank you, Roots.

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:08.874
Let's get to the news
and jokes.

00:00:08.874 --> 00:00:10.643
Well, guys,
after weeks of delays,

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:12.311
the White House
is finally giving

00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:15.081
President-elect Biden access
to something very important.

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:16.349
Watch this.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.384 line:0%
-2 1/2 weeks after Biden won,

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.753 line:0%
President Trump finally
giving formal approval

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:23.189 line:0%
for Biden to receive
the president's daily brief.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.623 line:0%
It's highly classified
information

00:00:24.623 --> 00:00:26.025 line:0%
that Biden will need.

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:27.793
-That's right,
the president-elect

00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:30.529
is finally
receiving Trump's daily brief.

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:33.867
Today, Biden was like,
"Okay, gotcha. That's right.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.701
Okay, this is a
'Marmaduke' cartoon.

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:38.738
So, is this --"
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:41.207
It's okay, Trump doesn't need
the daily brief anymore.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:44.077
He gets all his intelligence
from Randy Quaid's tweets.

00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:45.845
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:47.346
Thanks to Trump's daily brief,

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:50.049
Biden will now be well-versed
in foreign and domestic threats

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:52.252
and who got eliminated
on "The Bachelorette."

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:53.719
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:55.621
Actually, it does turn out
that the brief they give Biden

00:00:55.621 --> 00:00:57.890
is a little different than
the one they give Trump.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:59.359
I'll show you what I mean.
For instance,

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:02.829
Biden's brief says,
"Iran building nuclear arsenal."

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:05.431 line:0%
While Trump's brief says,
"Iran make big fireworks

00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:07.099 line:0%
that go boom-boom."

00:01:07.099 --> 00:01:10.469
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:12.071
Wow.

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:13.706
Next up, Biden's brief says,

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.475
"Norway experiencing
harsh climate change."

00:01:16.475 --> 00:01:19.846 line:0%
While Trump's says,
"Soon Olaf will be a puddle."

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:21.581
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:23.115
And finally, Biden's brief says,

00:01:23.115 --> 00:01:25.952
"Canada extends border
restrictions with U.S."

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:29.888 line:0%
While Trump's says, "Americans
betrayed by Beliebers."

00:01:29.888 --> 00:01:31.924
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:34.027
Just a little different.

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:36.563
Even though the transition has
already begun, Rudy Giuliani

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:39.398
is still trying to overturn
the election.

00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:41.734
Today he talked about
voter fraud at an event

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:44.069
in Gettysburg, Pennsylvania.

00:01:44.069 --> 00:01:45.938
People were pumped about
the event.

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:47.874
Not to hear Rudy's speech,
just to see

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:49.775
what's gonna leak
out of his head.

00:01:49.775 --> 00:01:52.111
It's almost Thanksgiving,
I hope it's gravy!

00:01:52.111 --> 00:01:53.512
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:55.514
But Rudy was smart this time.

00:01:55.514 --> 00:01:57.683
First he dyed his hair,
then he applied a coat

00:01:57.683 --> 00:01:59.786
of Thompson's WaterSeal
over it.

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:01.087
Very smart.

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:02.588
And this is very interesting.

00:02:02.588 --> 00:02:04.390
Trump was also supposed to be
in Gettysburg,

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.058
but he cancelled
at the last minute

00:02:06.058 --> 00:02:08.494
because of COVID concerns.

00:02:08.494 --> 00:02:10.696
-Hmm? What?

00:02:10.696 --> 00:02:12.131
-That's great. Trump was like,

00:02:12.131 --> 00:02:14.934
"It's not safe to be there
in person, so, Rudy, you go."

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.369
"Okay."

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:18.871
Trump ended up appearing over
speakerphone in Gettysburg,

00:02:18.871 --> 00:02:21.006
and he actually delivered
a speech inspired by

00:02:21.006 --> 00:02:22.908
Abraham Lincoln's
famous address.

00:02:22.908 --> 00:02:24.811
Here, check it out.

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:27.713
-Four seasons and seven
total landscapings ago,

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:29.748
the liberal media brought forth

00:02:29.748 --> 00:02:32.919
on this consonant,
a news so fake,

00:02:32.919 --> 00:02:35.254
conceived by the haters
and losers,

00:02:35.254 --> 00:02:36.722
can you believe it, folks,

00:02:36.722 --> 00:02:39.859
and dedicated to the
preposition that every person,

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:43.296
woman, man, camera,
TV was created equal.

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:44.897
-Okay, I got it.
That's it.

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:48.534
[ Applause ]

00:02:48.534 --> 00:02:51.370
Speaking of the President,
today he decided to pardon

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:55.007
his former National Security
Adviser, Michael Flynn.

00:02:55.007 --> 00:02:56.642
He announced it via tweet.

00:02:56.642 --> 00:02:59.111
He wrote, "It is my great honor
to announce that

00:02:59.111 --> 00:03:02.915
General Michael T. Flynn has
been granted a full pardon."

00:03:02.915 --> 00:03:05.250
On one hand,
Flynn is thrilled.

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.920
On the other, he's like, "You
pardoned the turkey before me?"

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:10.422
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.422 --> 00:03:12.791
When people heard the name
Michael Flynn, they were like,

00:03:12.791 --> 00:03:14.860
"Wow, they brought back
a character from season one

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:17.529
for the finale.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.529 --> 00:03:19.164
Cool!"
[ Applause ]

00:03:19.164 --> 00:03:21.834
That's how you do it.

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:23.670
Seriously, there's a name
from the past.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.003
Even Michael Flynn was like,

00:03:25.003 --> 00:03:26.773
"Damn, I totally forgot
about Michael Flynn."

00:03:26.773 --> 00:03:28.441
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:30.009
Here's some news about
the pandemic.

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:32.378
It looks like the CDC is
changing its recommendation

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:34.447
for how long you should
quarantine.

00:03:34.447 --> 00:03:37.049
Listen to this.
-The CDC is reportedly set

00:03:37.049 --> 00:03:39.518
to shorten its quarantine
recommendation.

00:03:39.518 --> 00:03:43.355
It could go from the current
14 days to between 7 and 10 days

00:03:43.355 --> 00:03:45.925
for those who might have been
exposed to the virus.

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:48.060
-Yep, this isn't based
on science.

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:50.630
It's just that there's nothing
left to binge on Netflix.

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.498
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:54.233
We already watched
the chess show.

00:03:54.233 --> 00:03:55.535
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.535 --> 00:03:56.969
We're good.

00:03:56.969 --> 00:03:58.470
Oh, if you're doing
some cooking tomorrow,

00:03:58.470 --> 00:03:59.738
you better listen to this.

00:03:59.738 --> 00:04:01.674
A popular kitchen appliance
is being recalled.

00:04:01.674 --> 00:04:02.975
Take a look.

00:04:02.975 --> 00:04:05.644 line:0%
-Sunbeam is voluntarily
recalling

00:04:05.644 --> 00:04:08.781 line:0%
nearly a million crock pot
six-quart multicookers.

00:04:08.781 --> 00:04:11.383 line:0%
The company says the cookers
can pressurize

00:04:11.383 --> 00:04:13.919 line:0%
when the lid is not
fully locked,

00:04:13.919 --> 00:04:16.422 line:0%
and that creates a burn hazard.

00:04:16.422 --> 00:04:18.558
-Anybody who watches
"This Is Us" was like,

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:19.859
"A little late!"

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:22.762
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:24.163
Yeah, people knew
something was up

00:04:24.163 --> 00:04:26.499
when the only button on the
crock pot was, "Good luck."

00:04:26.499 --> 00:04:28.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.601 --> 00:04:30.636
Hey, did you see this?
There's a live action movie

00:04:30.636 --> 00:04:33.038
about "Clifford the Big Red Dog"
coming out.

00:04:33.038 --> 00:04:35.741
And today we got our first
glimpse of Clifford.

00:04:35.741 --> 00:04:37.944
But some people are complaining
about how he looks.

00:04:37.944 --> 00:04:39.512
Let's take a look.

00:04:39.512 --> 00:04:41.414
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, no.

00:04:41.414 --> 00:04:43.549
-Wait!
[ Laughs ]

00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:45.718
-Clifford looks like
a soccer mom's teeth

00:04:45.718 --> 00:04:47.153
after a pitcher of sangria.

00:04:47.153 --> 00:04:51.991
[ Laughter ]

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:53.959
Apparently, people were
expecting Clifford to be

00:04:53.959 --> 00:04:57.230
Heinz ketchup red, and what they
got was Hunt's catsup.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.565
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.565 --> 00:05:01.100
And finally, check this out.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:04.002
A woman in Minnesota put some
old pears in her backyard,

00:05:04.002 --> 00:05:05.938
and I guess they were --
they got fermented,

00:05:05.938 --> 00:05:08.708
because look what happened
when a squirrel ate one.

00:05:08.708 --> 00:05:11.811 line:0%
-This squirrel out in Minnesota
accidentally got drunk

00:05:11.811 --> 00:05:13.946 line:0%
when he ate a fermented pear.

00:05:13.946 --> 00:05:16.182 line:0%
The homeowner says that she
threw out some pears

00:05:16.182 --> 00:05:17.983 line:0%
that she found at the
bottom of her fridge.

00:05:17.983 --> 00:05:20.753 line:0%
The squirrel got into the pears.
Luckily, he was fine,

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:24.023 line:0%
walked it off and came back in
the morning, was ready for more.

00:05:24.023 --> 00:05:28.227
[ Laughter ]

00:05:28.227 --> 00:05:29.629
-That's going to be everyone

00:05:29.629 --> 00:05:31.731
on their Thanksgiving Zoom
tomorrow.

